  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrappers for standalone web accessibility scanning — @axe-core/cli for the scan itself and axe-sarif-converter for the JSON→SARIF emission that feeds the Tamp security pipeline. Smart binary resolution: project-local node_modules/.bin → pnpm exec → npm exec → global PATH → pre-flight skip via AxeCoreBinaryResolver.IsAvailable. For in-browser-test a11y assertions, prefer @axe-core/playwright via Tamp.Npm + Tamp.Playwright instead — this package is for standalone URL scans against deployed environments.",
